	"data": "XRSH\n\nLinux shell running inside WebXR. \"Termux for VR.\"\nRepo: <https://codeberg.org/xrsh/xrsh>\nLicense: FOSS (A-Frame/Three.js based)\nStatus: Active development, working demo, ambitious roadmap\n\nWhat It Provides\nBoots a Linux VM (via v86 x86 emulation in JS) inside WebXR\nFull filesystem, command line, CodeMirror editing\nLivecoding with terminal auto-completion\nWASM support\nremotestorage integration\nGesture-based input\nPlans: nix package manager, X11/VNC\n\nRelevance to Spatial Authoring\nThe most…",
